              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "A U.S. Navy Grumman A-6E <i>Intruder</i> from attack squadron VA-95 <i>Green Lizards</i> aircraft dropping CBU-59 cluster bombs over Iranian targets in retaliation for the mining of the guided missile frigate USS <i>Samuel B. Roberts</i> (FFG-58) on 18 April 1988. VA-95 was assigned to Carrier Air Wing 11 (CVW-11) aboard the aircraft carrier USS <i>Enterprise</i> (CVN-65) for a deployment to the Western Pacific and the Indian Ocean from 5 January to 3 July 1988.",
                "source": "commons-desc-page"
              },
